  message: "[Wave-0 hygiene] WI-lodaz-dorug-vifab-kijas-pidom-kotif-liton-litik folded in as a TRUE_DUPLICATE (marked wont_do, duplicate_of this item). Both describe the same defect: meta.receiver is documented as a call-shape fact (spec ~817/823) but emitted on 0/110533 edges — method_call_recovery.py creates edges with call_construct + resolution_quality meta but omits receiver. This item remains the canonical tracker for that unpopulated-field work."  # a6df
